+#: GEMV) and ggml_mul_mat_a8 (prefill GEMM) both pass for Q6_K against real
+#: model weights, so excluding the type here costs the third dispatch branch
+#: only. In Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_M, Q6_K is 4 tensors out of 753.
+#:
+#: THIS CONTAINMENT IS NOT UNCONDITIONAL -- it has two consumers, and the right
+#: answer differs between them. Read this before extending it:
+#:
+#:   PER-FORWARD (``fused_mul_mat_gguf``): the type is dropped from
